+    /// `M-69`: a quarantine eviction finished by crash recovery destroys the same
+    /// records the in-process path would have -- it is the same durable
+    /// transaction, resumed -- so it must be accounted for the same way.  A
+    /// `segment_corruption` pending only moved a damaged batch into
+    /// `quarantine/`; nothing was destroyed and neither leg counts it.
